# Melanopsin conda environment

Run all Python, pytest, pip, and Jupyter commands in the **melanopsin** conda environment. Do not use the base Anaconda interpreter or any other env.

```powershell
conda run -n melanopsin python path\to\script.py
conda run -n melanopsin pytest
```

In an interactive PowerShell session you can also `conda activate melanopsin` first, then call `python` / `pytest` as usual.

Wrong: `python tests/check_timestep_convergence.py` (picks up base/system Python).
Right: `conda run -n melanopsin python tests/check_timestep_convergence.py`
